# DF-031: byte-exact files must survive checkout unchanged.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which
# rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout for anything Git treats as text. Several
# DF-031 files are asserted by SHA-256, so that rewrite would change their bytes
# and fail the assertions on a fresh clone even though nothing was edited:
#
#   fonts/*-LICENSE.txt      must stay byte-identical to the exact pinned
#                            upstream governing LICENSE (plan.md §10.1
#                            property 8), asserted in test/han_font_asset_test.dart
#   tool/fonts/cldr/*.xml    pinned repertoire inputs, hash-verified by
#                            tool/fonts/build_han_subsets.py before it generates
#   fonts/*-NOTICE.txt       compared byte-for-byte when reproducing the build
#   tool/fonts/manifests/*   ditto
#
# `-text` disables all line-ending conversion for these paths.
fonts/*-LICENSE.txt -text
fonts/*-NOTICE.txt -text
tool/fonts/cldr/*.xml -text
tool/fonts/manifests/* -text

# Font binaries are never text.
fonts/*.otf binary
fonts/*.ttf binary
